/* Source-of-truth localization table. Keys are dotted by feature
   (`settings.privacy.last_seen`, `chat.input.placeholder`, etc.).
   English copy here is the development language; other lproj
   files inherit any missing key from this file via the
   `String.localized` extension's bundle fallback.

   Convention: ALL user-visible strings should route through
   `"key".localized`. Hardcoded English literals are tech debt —
   migrate them as you touch each view.
*/

