"item.faq.enhance.body" = "Spend Gems to raise an item's level (+1, +2 … up to +9). Each level multiplies its Essence. But every attempt has a burn chance that grows as the level climbs — the first levels are safe, the last ones are near-Russian-roulette. A failed attempt destroys the item. High risk, high reward.";
