"item.faq.equip.body" = "Equipping makes an item active: a pet appears as a small companion over your status icon everywhere in the app — and an equipped pet passively earns tokens over time; cosmetic packs unlock their content for use. An equipped item can't be sold or disassembled until you unequip it.";
